混入此其王。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p055","quote":"其秋，匈奴大入定襄、雲中，殺略數千人，敗數二千石而去，行破壞光祿所築城列亭鄣。又使右賢王入酒泉、張掖，略數千人。會任文擊救，盡復失所得而去。是歳，貳師將軍破大宛，斬其王而還。匈奴欲遮之，不能至。其冬，欲攻受降城，會單于病死。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m055-0082"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p033","quote":"於是貳師后復行，兵多，而所至小國莫不迎，出食給軍。至侖頭，侖頭不下，攻數日，屠之。自此而西，平行至宛城，漢兵到者三萬人。宛兵迎擊漢兵，漢兵射敗之，宛走入葆乘其城。貳師兵欲行攻郁成，恐留行而令宛益生詐，乃先至宛，決其水源，移之，則宛固已憂困。圍其城，攻之四十餘日，其外城壞，虜宛貴人勇將煎靡。宛大恐，走入中城。宛貴人相與謀曰：「漢所為攻宛，以王毋寡匿善馬而殺漢使。今殺王毋寡而出善馬，漢兵宜解；即不解，乃力戰而死，未晚也。」宛貴人皆以為然，共殺其王毋寡，持其頭遣貴人使貳師，約曰：「漢毋攻我。我盡出善馬，恣所取，而給漢軍食。即不聽，我盡殺善馬，而康居之救且至。至，我居內，康居居外，與漢軍戰。漢軍熟計之，何從？」是時康居候視漢兵，漢兵尚盛，不敢進。貳師與趙始成、李哆等計：「聞宛城中新得秦人，知穿井，而其內食尚多。所為來，誅首惡者毋寡。毋寡頭已至，如此而不許解兵，則堅守，而康居候漢罷而來救宛，破漢軍必矣。」軍吏皆以為然，許宛之約。宛乃出其善馬，令漢自擇之，而多出食食給漢軍。漢軍取其善馬數十匹。中馬以下牡牝三千餘匹，而立宛貴人之故待遇漢使善者名昧蔡以為宛王，與盟而罷兵。終不得入中城。乃罷而引歸。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0171","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0184","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0223","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0364","c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0367"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p036","quote":"漢已伐宛，立昧蔡為宛王而去。歲餘，宛貴人以為昧蔡善諛，使我國遇屠，乃相與殺昧蔡，立毋寡昆弟曰蟬封為宛王，而遣其子入質於漢。漢因使使賂賜以鎮撫之。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-123-dayuan:m036-0041"]}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false,"identity_materialized":true}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p055","text":"其秋，匈奴大入定襄、雲中，殺略數千人，敗數二千石而去，行破壞光祿所築城列亭鄣。又使右賢王入酒泉、張掖，略數千人。會任文擊救，盡復失所得而去。是歳，貳師將軍破大宛，斬其王而還。匈奴欲遮之，不能至。其冬，欲攻受降城，會單于病死。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m055-0020","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"數二千石","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m055-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"光祿","kind":"person","person_id":"3jt_wmb_7c3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m055-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"右賢王","kind":"person","person_id":"vd6_d8h_lr2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m055-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"任文","kind":"person","person_id":"x5r_2mn_f36","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m055-0073","start":73,"end":77,"surface":"貳師將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m055-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"其王","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m055-0091","start":91,"end":92,"surface":"之","kind":"pronoun","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m055-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_AABB","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p029","text":"而漢使者往既多，其少從率多進熟於天子，言曰：「宛有善馬在貳師城，匿不肯與漢使。」天子既好宛馬，聞之甘心，使壯士車令等持千金及金馬以請宛王貳師城善馬。宛國饒漢物，相與謀曰：「漢去我遠，而鹽水中數敗，出其北有胡寇，出其南乏水草。又且往往而絕邑，乏食者多。漢使數百人為輩來，而常乏食，死者過半，是安能致大軍乎？無柰我何。且貳師馬，宛寶馬也。」遂不肯予漢使。漢使怒，妄言，椎金馬而去。宛貴人怒曰：「漢使至輕我！」遣漢使去，令其東邊郁成遮攻殺漢使，取其財物。於是天子大怒。諸嘗使宛姚定漢等言宛兵弱，誠以漢兵不過三千人，彊弩射之，即盡虜破宛矣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"mws_e02_g1o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"mws_e02_g1o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"車令","kind":"person","person_id":"l7y_ed2_wom","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"宛王","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0188","start":188,"end":191,"surface":"宛貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"mws_e02_g1o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m029-0235","start":235,"end":238,"surface":"姚定漢","kind":"person","person_id":"pbn_4mh_7ix","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","book_id":"b-shiji-123","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p032","text":"其夏，漢亡浞野之兵二萬餘於匈奴。公卿及議者皆願罷擊宛軍，專力攻胡。天子已業誅宛，宛小國而不能下，則大夏之屬輕漢，而宛善馬絕不來，烏孫、侖頭易苦漢使矣，為外國笑。乃案言伐宛尤不便者鄧光等，赦囚徒材官，益發惡少年及邊騎，歲餘而出敦煌者六萬人，負私從者不與。牛十萬，馬三萬餘匹，驢騾橐它以萬數。多齎糧，兵弩甚設，天下騷動，傳相奉伐宛，凡五十餘校尉。宛王城中無井，皆汲城外流水，於是乃遣水工徙其城下水空以空其城。益發戍甲卒十八萬，酒泉、張掖北，置居延、休屠以衛酒泉，而發天下七科適，及載糒給貳師。轉車人徒相連屬至敦煌。而拜習馬者二人為執驅校尉，備破宛擇取其善馬云。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"浞野","kind":"person","person_id":"z0l_1wp_de1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"mws_e02_g1o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"鄧光","kind":"person","person_id":"o5r_zwu_65v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"宛王","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m032-0257","start":257,"end":262,"surface":"習馬者二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan","book_id":"b-shiji-123","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji123-dayuan"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p033","text":"於是貳師后復行，兵多，而所至小國莫不迎，出食給軍。至侖頭，侖頭不下，攻數日，屠之。自此而西，平行至宛城，漢兵到者三萬人。宛兵迎擊漢兵，漢兵射敗之，宛走入葆乘其城。貳師兵欲行攻郁成，恐留行而令宛益生詐，乃先至宛，決其水源，移之，則宛固已憂困。圍其城，攻之四十餘日，其外城壞，虜宛貴人勇將煎靡。宛大恐，走入中城。宛貴人相與謀曰：「漢所為攻宛，以王毋寡匿善馬而殺漢使。今殺王毋寡而出善馬，漢兵宜解；即不解，乃力戰而死，未晚也。」宛貴人皆以為然，共殺其王毋寡，持其頭遣貴人使貳師，約曰：「漢毋攻我。我盡出善馬，恣所取，而給漢軍食。即不聽，我盡殺善馬，而康居之救且至。至，我居內，康居居外，與漢軍戰。漢軍熟計之，何從？」是時康居候視漢兵，漢兵尚盛，不敢進。貳師與趙始成、李哆等計：「聞宛城中新得秦人，知穿井，而其內食尚多。所為來，誅首惡者毋寡。毋寡頭已至，如此而不許解兵，則堅守，而康居候漢罷而來救宛，破漢軍必矣。」軍吏皆以為然，許宛之約。宛乃出其善馬，令漢自擇之，而多出食食給漢軍。漢軍取其善馬數十匹。中馬以下牡牝三千餘匹，而立宛貴人之故待遇漢使善者名昧蔡以為宛王，與盟而罷兵。終不得入中城。乃罷而引歸。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0137","start":137,"end":140,"surface":"宛貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"煎靡","kind":"person","person_id":"ral_28k_rwc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0154","start":154,"end":157,"surface":"宛貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"毋寡","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0184","start":184,"end":186,"surface":"毋寡","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0211","start":211,"end":214,"surface":"宛貴人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0223","start":223,"end":225,"surface":"毋寡","kind":"person","person_id":"2l2_58b_q4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m033-0323","start":323,"end":325,"surface":"貳師","kind":"person","person_id":"pez_8dn_r76","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-da